If the signal strength is greater than or equal to 128 dB over 1 microvolt per meter (dBuV/m), the color Red
(255, 0, 0) is displayed for the region. If the signal strength is greater than or equal to 118 dBuV/m, but
less than 128 dBuV/m, then the color Orange (255, 165, 0) is displayed, and so on. Greyscale terrain is dis-
played for regions with signal strengths less than 8 dBuV/m.
